---
source: tests/surface_snapshots.rs
expression: "help(&[verb])"
---
Print the embedded agent skill, or install or check the installed one

Usage: mnemex skill [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --install [<DIR>]  Write the skill to DIR/SKILL.md. Defaults to ~/.agents/skills/mnemex
      --check [<DIR>]    Exit 1 when DIR/SKILL.md is missing or differs from the embedded skill
  -h, --help             Print help
